Adaptation_method:
Update your test setup code (typically in test-helper.js) to explicitly call these functions:

```diff
+import { loadTests } from 'ember-qunit/test-loader';
-import { start } from 'ember-qunit';
+import { start, setupEmberOnerrorValidation } from 'ember-qunit';

+setupEmberOnerrorValidation();
+loadTests();
start();
```

Note: If you're using ember-exam, you need to add setupEmberOnerrorValidation() as ember-exam's start() already calls loadTests() for you:

```diff
import start from 'ember-exam/test-support/start';
+import { setupEmberOnerrorValidation } from 'ember-qunit';

+setupEmberOnerrorValidation();
start();
```
